<p dir="ltr">Na maaro na maaro mujhe(2)<br> Mein sakina mein sakina mein yateema hoo mujhe Pathar pathar na maaro</p> 
<p dir="ltr">Mein baba ki raaj dulaari<br> apne chacha ko jaan se pyaari<br> Mein pardesi hoo dukhyari&nbsp;<br> dekh rahe ho aawo zaari<br> Margaye waris ab tanha hoo</p> 
<p dir="ltr">Mein sakina....</p> 
<p dir="ltr">Paani mangu toh mat dena&nbsp;<br> seekh liya hai pyaasi rehna&nbsp;<br> Guth kar jeena guth kar marna&nbsp;<br> lekin yeh kaisa hai kareena<br> Dekh lo nabze mein laasha hoo</p> 
<p dir="ltr">Baba se thi jung tumhari&nbsp;<br> bacho se kya hai bezaari<br> Saans ruk jaati hai hamari&nbsp;<br> chalne mein bhi hai dushwaari<br> Chaar baras ki zaeefa hoo</p> 
<p dir="ltr">Khoon rawa kaano se hamare<br> Tumune tamache itne maare<br> Kaash jo ammu hote pyaare&nbsp;<br> so gaye wo toh neher kanaare<br> Phir bhi dekho zinda hoo</p> 
<p dir="ltr">Chin gaya mujhse aapka seena<br> Bhool chuki hok raat ko sona<br> Dard ka takiya ghum ka bichona&nbsp;<br> Pyaas lage toh aansoo peena<br> ek diya jalta bhujta hoo</p> 
<p dir="ltr">Ghar se chali toh shehzaadi thi<br> Ranjo alam ki kab aadi thi<br> Qismat mein yeh karwa di thi<br> Paani ki kab faryaadi thi<br> Naado paani mein tishna hoo</p> 
<p dir="ltr">Besar laashe gaur andhera&nbsp;<br> Khoon ki boo hai ghum ka pehra<br> Zakhm kaleje ka hai gehra<br> Aansoo hai rukhsaar pe thehra<br> Chaar baras ki zaaefa hoo</p> 
<p dir="ltr">Pursa hai yeh rehano raza ka<br> Ae shahzaadi dard ki malika&nbsp;<br> Haay tera taboot na utha<br> Tera toh marqad qaidi tha<br> Kehti rahi tu mein dukhiya hoo</p>